# This repo is authored on Windows and executed on Linux.
#
# Without this, Git checks files out with CRLF line endings and a single
# trailing \r turns "#!/usr/bin/env bash" into "bad interpreter: no such file
# or directory" at runtime - with the script looking completely correct in
# every editor. Force LF everywhere; nothing here is consumed by a Windows
# program that needs CRLF.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-ending converted.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
*.woff2 binary
*.iso binary
